      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For maximum equity, a blended model combining income eligibility with a transparent lottery system for those who qualify is generally recommended. This approach ensures low-income residents are prioritized while using random selection to prevent landlord protectionism and guarantee fair access for everyone on the waiting list. A strict income-only filter might exclude some eligible families, whereas geography-based selection often fails to address systemic barriers that keep low-income individuals away from transit hubs. Your brief should propose this hybrid framework to balance fiscal responsibility with the fundamental promise of affordable housing.",
